# Oracle BI Publisher jars and the IBM Db2 JDBC driver are not redistributable
# from this repo; the RTF template (~23 MB with embedded images) and DB
# credentials stay on the Skynet host. See README.md for how they get there.
vendor/
template/
.env
# Oracle-built RTFs (Word/Template Builder, ~23 MB) stay on Skynet; generated ones are tracked.
reports/inventory-aging/*.rtf
